Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:08.02,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:08.02,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}斯瓦泰克 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}4-6 6-1 6-1{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 萨卡里 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:01.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And in just under two hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:01.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,两个小时不到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:04.60,EN,,0,0,0,,it ends with another Sakkari unforced error
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨卡里又一次非受迫失误
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:05.72,EN,,0,0,0,,into the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:05.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,球下网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:07.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Wasn't vintage Iga today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:07.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天不是巅峰状态的斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.64,0:00:10.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Didn't get a break point even in the first set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.64,0:00:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,首盘她一个破发点都没拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.96,EN,,0,0,0,,for the first time this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,本赛季第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:14.84,EN,,0,0,0,,But how she came back, not spectacular,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,但她扳回来的方式 算不上华丽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:17.72,EN,,0,0,0,,but very reliable and very consistent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:17.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,却非常可靠 非常稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:19.32,EN,,0,0,0,,dropping just two games,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:19.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,只丢了两局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:22.04,EN,,0,0,0,,one in each of the second and third sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:22.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘和第三盘各一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:24.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Comes through it 6-1 in the third.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,决胜盘六比一过关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:26.28,EN,,0,0,0,,The defending champion safely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:26.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,卫冕冠军稳稳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:29.08,EN,,0,0,0,,through to the last 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:29.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进 1/8 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:31.64,EN,,0,0,0,,How important it is in this kind of weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样的天气里 这一点太重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:33.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Iga, let's talk a little bit about the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:33.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克 我们聊聊这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.00,EN,,0,0,0,,You turn things around today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天把局面扭了过来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's take you right after the first set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,回到第一盘刚结束那会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:42.48,EN,,0,0,0,,How did you turn things around today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天是怎么扭过来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.60,EN,,0,0,0,,It's hard to analyze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,这很难分析
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:46.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I felt like I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:46.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 我觉得自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.52,0:00:48.44,EN,,0,0,0,,was playing quite good in a first set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.52,0:00:48.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一盘打得挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:50.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Sometimes just lacked maybe precision,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:50.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是有时候差了点精准度
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.76,EN,,0,0,0,,played too much to Maria
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,太多球送到了萨卡里手上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and she used the opportunities
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,她抓住了这些机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:55.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and was playing, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:55.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且她的球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:00:58.20,EN,,0,0,0,,faster than me I felt like or deeper,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:00:58.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我感觉比我更快 或者更深
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:00:58.68,EN,,0,0,0,,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:00:58.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:00:59.80,EN,,0,0,0,,So I really wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:00:59.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我很想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:02.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to start pushing her so she doesn't get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:02.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,开始压制她 别让她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:03.72,EN,,0,0,0,,so many opportunities
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:03.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿到那么多机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.72,0:01:07.24,EN,,0,0,0,,to you know push me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.72,0:01:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,反过来压制我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:08.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:08.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.12,0:01:09.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that in a second set it started working
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.12,0:01:09.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘开始奏效了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:13.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and I played a bit better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:13.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也打得好了一些
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:14.44,EN,,0,0,0,,She started making mistakes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,她开始出现失误
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:15.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and I knew you know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:16.76,EN,,0,0,0,,the momentum changed a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:16.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,势头有了一点变化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:18.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and now it's time to push.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:18.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,该发力了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:20.28,EN,,0,0,0,,You flipped a switch that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你确实像按了个开关
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.28,0:01:21.56,EN,,0,0,0,,You've been very vocal lately
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.28,0:01:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你最近常常谈到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:24.04,EN,,0,0,0,,about balancing life off the court
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么平衡场外的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:24.60,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,和场上的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:26.12,EN,,0,0,0,,You seem like you're in such a good place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:26.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在的状态看起来非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:27.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think Cincinnati might have a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想辛辛那提
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:28.76,EN,,0,0,0,,to do with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.88,0:01:28.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,和这有很大关系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:29.88,EN,,0,0,0,,The fans, they see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,球迷们看见你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:31.08,EN,,0,0,0,,You walk out on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你走上球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:32.92,EN,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of love for you here in Mason,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,在梅森这里 大家非常喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:34.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,俄亥俄州
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:35.64,EN,,0,0,0,,What kind of place does that put you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:35.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这会让你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:36.84,EN,,0,0,0,,in mentally when you walk out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:36.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,走上这样一片球场时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.60,EN,,0,0,0,,on a court like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,心里是什么状态？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:39.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:39.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,今年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:41.72,EN,,0,0,0,,not much time to spend, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有太多时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.44,EN,,0,0,0,,off the court cuz we came here pretty late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,待在场外 因为我们来得挺晚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:46.76,EN,,0,0,0,,But I'm happy, you know, that tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我很高兴 明天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.76,0:01:48.52,EN,,0,0,0,,might have some time to just chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.76,0:01:48.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许能有点时间放松
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:51.16,EN,,0,0,0,,And Cincinnati for sure is a place to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:51.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提绝对适合做这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:52.60,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:54.36,EN,,0,0,0,,maybe we'll go eat some good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:54.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许我们会去吃点好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:56.44,EN,,0,0,0,,And thank you guys for being so welcoming
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:56.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们这么热情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:57.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and being so nice
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么友好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.32,0:01:58.52,EN,,0,0,0,,because this is the big part
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.32,0:01:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为这正是这项赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:01:59.64,EN,,0,0,0,,of this tournament, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:01:59.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,很重要的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:00.52,EN,,0,0,0,,the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里的氛围
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:02.28,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm really happy to be here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我真的很高兴能在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.28,0:02:03.24,EN,,0,0,0,,for next days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.28,0:02:03.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,待上接下来几天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, we love having you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们也很高兴你在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:05.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Well done, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得漂亮 女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:08.02,EN,,0,0,0,,Iga Swiatek.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:08.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克
